<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;">Direct</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> Read:</span><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">  2.6</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> GB/s</span></span>
